# Gitea 私有 npm registry 消费侧配置示例
# 复制到 ~/.npmrc（发布机/消费机都要），TOKEN 换成有 packages:read（发布机还需 packages:write）权限的 Gitea token
#
# @aigility-harness:registry=https://git.aigility.cloud/api/packages/AIGility-Cloud-Innovation/npm/
# //git.aigility.cloud/api/packages/AIGility-Cloud-Innovation/npm/:_authToken=<TOKEN>
# always-auth=true
#
# 验证：
#   npm view @aigility-harness/core --registry https://git.aigility.cloud/api/packages/AIGility-Cloud-Innovation/npm/
